Staging means selecting changes that you want to include in your next commit.

git add file.py	--- Stage a particular file
git add .	--- Stage changes in current directory
git add -A	--- Stage all changes across repository
git add *.py	--- Stage matching Python files
git restore --staged file.py --- Remove file from staging
git rm file.py	--- Delete file and stage deletion
git mv old.py new.py --- Rename or move a tracked file
